@startuml
title Test #13: 写入 literal 抛错（设计约束）

object "Before" as ib {
  literal node (read-only)
}

object "After" as ia {
  (no change)
}

ib ..> ia : executeMove(\n  from={kind:'literal', value:'x'}\n  to  ={kind:'literal', value:'y'}\n) ✗ AddressError /literal/

note right of ia
  **验证（连续两步）**
  rejects.toThrow(AddressError) ✓
  rejects.toThrow(/literal/) ✓
  （literal 是只读常量节点）
end note

@enduml
